+# Audit 0.19.0: the ritual builder
+
+Method: design review only (detector not applicable, native platform): impeccable critique and
+graphic-design-fundamentals §13, on `ritual_checklist_ptBR_light`.
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals §13
+
+| # | Check | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | Write the routine once, tick it each time. ✅ |
+| 2 | Concept | A checklist like a consultant's card, in her words. ✅ |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | Steps in order; a tick is a blush round with a check. ✅ |
+| 4 | Contrast | `on-selected` check on the blush 12:1; text unchanged when ticked (no strike-through, stays readable). ✅ |
+| 5 | Alignment | Rows on the group's inset. ✅ |
+| 6 | Spacing | Row group, 56dp rows. ✅ |
+| 7 | Typography | Body role. ✅ |
+| 8 | Colour | Blush for done; never teal. ✅ |
+| 9 | Consistency | Row group and the system's check icon (`gg_ic_check`). ✅ |
+| 10 | Simplicity | Slide still logs without the list. ✅ |
+| 11 | Real size | Phone width, PT. ✅ |
+| 12 | Accessibility | Rows are checkboxes for TalkBack. ✅ |
+| 13 | Production | The check icon came from the design system's set (not redrawn). ✅ |
+
+Caught during the build: a new check icon was about to replace the design system's own
+`gg_ic_check`; the system's icon was used instead.
+
+## impeccable critique
+
+| # | Heuristic | Score | Note |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | System status | 4 | Ticks show at once. |
+| 2 | Real world | 4 | Her steps, her words. |
+| 3 | Control | 4 | Edit, add, remove; untick. |
+| 4 | Consistency | 4 | Same rows, same check. |
+| 5 | Error prevention | 3 | Length and count limits. |
+| 6 | Recognition | 4 | The list is there when the routine opens. |
+| 7 | Efficiency | 4 | One tap per step; slide skips it. |
+| 8 | Aesthetic | 4 | Calm list. |
+| 9 | Error recovery | 3 | Cancel keeps the old steps. |
+| 10 | Help | 3 | One line says how. |
+| | **Total** | **37/40** | |
